<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON:Alan Ruttenberg"@en .
