# http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000200
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000200> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000200> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000200> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:genid17 .
_:genid17 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:genid19 .
_:genid19 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:genid18 .
_:genid18 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:genid18 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000035> .
_:genid18 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
