_:genid27 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:genid26 .
_:genid26 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:genid26 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000020> .
