# http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002328
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002328> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002328> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A grouping relationship for any relationship directly involving a function, or that holds because of a function of one of the related entities." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002328> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "This is the soft version of mathematical dependence. We would like to introduce oparator classes later (derivative, quotient, sum, difference, product) with appropriate properties for the terms.\n\ndifference === ('has minuend' only entity) and ('has subtrahend' only entity)\nsum === 'has addend' some entity\nproduct === 'has factor' some entity\nquotient === ('has numerator' only entity) and ('has denominator' only entity)\nderivative === ('has differential numerator' only entity) and ('has differential denominator' only entity)"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002328> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "functionally related to"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002328> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002328> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002328> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A grouping relationship for any relationship directly involving a function, or that holds because of a function of one of the related entities."@en .
