<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025998> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025998> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025998> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has relational quality"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025998> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hat relationale Qualität"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025998> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a relation between an independent continuant (the bearer) and a relational quality, in which the quality specifically depends on the bearer for its existence"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025998> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "eine Beziehung zwischen einem unabhängigen Kontinuum (dem Träger) und einer relationalen Qualität, bei der die Qualität in ihrer Existenz speziell vom Träger abhängt"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025998> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "material has relational quality mass proportion m, and portion of iron has the same relational quality mass proportion m"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#propertyChainAxiom> _:genid55 .
_:genid55 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:genid54 .
_:genid54 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:genid54 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> .
_:genid54 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
_:genid55 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999> .
_:genid55 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "The 'relational quality of' is more strict that 'quality of' from RO, since domain is 'relational quality'. The motivtion to introduce an object property for relational qualities is the following:\nRO's 'quality of' is functional i.e., a->b, a->c => b=c. The functionality is relevant for most of the SDC -> IC triples, expect for relational qualities, which per definiton can be simultaneously inherited in >=2 ICs. Thus,  'relational quality of'  has the same intention to connect SDC to IC, however, without cardinality constraints."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "relational quality of"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "relationale Qualität von"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a relation between a relational quality and an independent continuant (the bearer), in which the quality specifically depends on the bearer for its existence"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "eine Beziehung zwischen einer relationalen Qualität und einem unabhängigen Kontinuum (dem Träger), bei der die Existenz der Qualität speziell vom Träger abhängt"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025999> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "mass proportion m is relational qualitiy of material, and the same mass proportion m is relational qualitiy of portion of iron"@en .
