<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000070> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "Assay the wavelength of light emitted by excited Neon atoms. Count of geese flying over a house." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000070> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000070> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A planned process that has the objective to produce information about a material entity (the evaluant) by examining it."@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000070> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "12/3/12: BP: the reference to the 'physical examination' is included to point out that a prediction is not an assay, as that does not require physical examiniation." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000070> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Discussion on OBI call 2023-05-01 resulted in an agreement to revise the textual definition of 'assay'.  https://github.com/obi-ontology/obi/issues/1683." .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000070> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PlanAndPlannedProcess Branch"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000070> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "OBI branch derived"@en .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000070> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "assay"@en .
