<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000571> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> "With respect to The Accuri C6 Flow Cytometer System, the organization Accuri bears the role manufacturer role.  With respect to a transformed line of tissue culture cells derived by a specific lab, the lab whose personnel isolated the cll line bears the role manufacturer role.  With respect to a specific antibody produced by an individual scientist, the scientist who purifies, characterizes and distributes the anitbody bears the role manufacturer role." .
