<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A plan specification that prescribes the ordered application of one or more workflow functions, including their interconnections via input and output specifications, in order to achieve a specified computational objective."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000012> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001032> "https://github.com/materialdigital/core-ontology/issues/246" .
