<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000542> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000542> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CNC-Schweißmaschine"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000542> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "cnc welding machine"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000542> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A cnc machine that performs welding operations."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000542> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Eine CNC-Schweißmaschine ist eine CNC-Maschine, die Schweißoperationen ausführt."@de .
