_:genid343 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
_:genid339 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000080> .
_:genid339 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "See the editor note of composition to understand the difference between composition and chemical composition.\n\nSee the pattern example of composition to underatand the difference between composition and proportion."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "chemical composition"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "chemische Zusammensetzung"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Die chemische Zusammensetzung ist eine intensive Eigenschaft eines Materieteils, die die Arten und Anteile reiner chemischer Elemente in dem Materieteil beschreibt, und ist Gegenstand einiger Datenelemente zur chemischen Zusammensetzung."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The chemical composition is an intensive quality of a portion of matter which describes the types and proportions of pure chemical elements in the portion of matter, and it is a subject of some chemical composition data item."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000064> "Material has quality chemical composition. Chemical composition is a subject of chemical composition data item. Chemical composition data item has members fraction value specifications (which have a numeral and a unit). Material has part portion of carbon. Material has relational quality mass proportion. Portion of carbon  has relational quality mass proportion. Mass propotion is specified by value fraction value specification. Same approach for all chemical elements."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000957> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid344 .
_:genid344 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000551> .
_:genid344 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0009006> .
_:genid344 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Analyseverfahren für die chemische Zusammensetzung"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "chemical composition analyzing process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A structural property analyzing process that determines the chemical composition of a material by identifying and quantifying its constituent elements and compounds."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Struktur Eigenschaften Analyseverfahren, das die chemische Zusammensetzung eines Materials bestimmt, indem es dessen Bestandteile und Verbindungen identifiziert und quantifiziert."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080116> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "chemical potential"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "chemisches Potential"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "a quality of a thermodynamic system describing the energy change associated with the addition of a small quantity of a substance to a system at constant temperature and pressure."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "eine intensive Qualität eines thermodynamischen Systems, die die Energieänderung beschreibt, die mit der Zugabe einer kleinen Menge einer Substanz zu einem System bei konstanter Temperatur und konstantem Druck verbunden ist."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000553> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000070> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Chemische Eigenschaften Analyseverfahren"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "chemical property analyzing process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An assay that determines the chemical composition, reactivity, and chemical stability of materials, including the identification and quantification of chemical elements and compounds."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000554> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Eine Analyse, die die chemische Zusammensetzung, Reaktivität und chemische Stabilität von Materialien bestimmt, einschließlich der Identifizierung und Quantifizierung chemischer Elemente und Verbindungen."@de .
# 
