<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000615> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "drilling machine"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000615> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A forming machine that creates holes in a workpiece by means of a rotating drill bit."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000615> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Eine Formmaschine, die Löcher in einem Werkstück durch ein sich drehendes Bohrwerkzeug erzeugt."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000616
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000616> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
