<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A mechanical property analyzing process that measures the mechanical properties of a material as a function of temperature, time, frequency, and stress, determining its viscoelastic behavior."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Mechanische Eigenschaften Analyseverfahren, welcher die mechanischen Eigenschaften eines Materials in Abhängigkeit von Temperatur, Zeit, Frequenz und Spannung misst und dessen viskoelastisches Verhalten bestimmt."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Dynamic mechanical analysis of a rubber compound to assess its stiffness and damping properties over a range of temperatures."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000616> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0050117> "DMA"@en .
