<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000620> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "electrical conductivity"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000620> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "elektrische Leitfähigkeit"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000620> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Die elektrische Leitfähigkeit ist eine elektrische Eigenschaft, die die Fähigkeit eines Materials beschreibt, elektrischen Strom zu leiten, beeinflusst von seiner Struktur und Zusammensetzung."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000620> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The electrical conductivity is an electrical property describing the ability of a material to conduct electric current, influenced by its structure and composition."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000620> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000621
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000621> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000621> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DEPRECATED electrical property"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000621> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DEPRECATED elektrische Eigenschaft"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000621> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020312> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000621> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000621> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED An electrical property is a material property that represents the characteristics of a material that determine its behavior under the influence of an electric field, such as conductivity, resistivity, and permittivity."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000621> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED Eine elektrische Eigenschaft ist eine Materialeigenschaft, die die Eigenschaften eines Materials darstellt, die sein Verhalten unter dem Einfluss eines elektrischen Feldes bestimmen, wie z. B. Leitfähigkeit, spezifischer Widerstand und Permittivität."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000622
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000622> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000622> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000070> .
