<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000647> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Offizielle Definition findet man in: DIN 8586"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000647> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Biegeumformen"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000647> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "forming by bending"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A forming process that involves bending materials, typically used in manipulating sheets, tubes, or profiles into curved shapes or angles, common in metalworking and fabrication industries."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Umform Prozess, der das Biegen von Materialien beinhaltet und typischerweise bei der Bearbeitung von Blechen, Rohren oder Profilen zu gekrümmten Formen oder Winkeln eingesetzt wird, wie es in der Metallverarbeitung und in der verarbeitenden Industrie üblich ist."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Bending With Linear Die Movement, Bending With Rotary Die Movement"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000648
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000648> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000648> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000648> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000648> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000648> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Formmaschine"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000648> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "forming machine"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A device used for shaping materials under various conditions, including tensile, compressive, and shearing."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Gerät zur Formgebung von Materialien unter verschiedenen Bedingungen, einschließlich Zug-, Druck- und Scherbedingungen."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000649
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000649> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000649> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000646> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000649> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "Official definition can be found in: DIN 8584-1"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000649> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Offizielle Definition findet man in: DIN 8584-1"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000649> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Zugdruckumformen"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000649> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "forming under compressive and tensile conditions"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A forming process that involves applying both tensile and compressive forces to a material."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Umform Prozess, bei dem sowohl Zug- als auch Druckkräfte auf ein Material ausgeübt werden."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Stripping, Deep Drawing, Spinning"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000650
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000650> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000650> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000646> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000650> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "Official definition can be found in: DIN 8583-1"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000650> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Offizielle Definition findet man in: DIN 8583-1"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000650> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Druckumformen"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000650> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "forming under compressive conditions"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A forming process that involves deforming materials under compressive forces, commonly used in techniques like rolling and die forming where metal is shaped by applying pressure."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Umform Prozess, bei dem Materialien unter Druck verformt werden. Er wird üblicherweise bei Techniken wie Walzen und  Gesenkformen eingesetzt, bei denen Metall durch Druck in Form gebracht wird."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Rolling, Coining"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000651
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000651> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000651> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000646> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000651> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "Official definition can be found in: DIN 8587"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000651> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Offizielle Definition findet man in: DIN 8587"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000651> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Schubumformen"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000651> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "forming under shearing conditions"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A forming process that involves displacement or twisting materials to achieve deformation, often used in operations where materials are shaped by applying torsional forces."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Umform Prozess, bei dem Werkstoffe durch Verschieben oder Verdrehen verformt werden. Es wird häufig bei Verfahren verwendet, bei denen Werkstoffe durch Anwendung von Torsionskräften geformt werden."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Twisting, Displacement"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000652
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000652> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000652> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000646> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000652> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "Official definition can be found in: DIN 8585-1"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000652> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "Offizielle Definition findet man in: DIN 8585-1"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000652> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Zugumformen"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000652> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "forming under tensile conditions"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000652> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A forming process that involves stretching or elongating materials to achieve desired dimensions or shapes."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000652> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Umform Prozess, bei dem Materialien gestreckt oder gedehnt werden, um die gewünschten Abmessungen oder Formen zu erreichen."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000652> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Expanding, Stretch Forming"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000653
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000653> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000653> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000653> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000653> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000653> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bruchzähigkeitsprüfverfahren"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000653> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "fracture toughness testing process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A mechanical property analyzing process that assesses a material's ability to resist crack propagation, determining its fracture toughness."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Mechanische Eigenschaften Analyseverfahren, das die Fähigkeit eines Materials bewertet, der Rissausbreitung zu widerstehen, und seine Bruchzähigkeit bestimmt."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Measuring the fracture toughness of ceramic materials used in aerospace components to ensure reliability under stress."@en .
