<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000659> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Gelpermeations-Chromatographiesystem"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000659> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "gel permeation chromatography system"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000659> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A chromatography system used for separating and analyzing polymers based on their molecular size using gel permeation chromatography."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000659> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Chromatographiesystem zur Trennung und Analyse von Polymeren basierend auf ihrer Molekülgröße durch Gelpermeationschromatographie."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000660
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000660> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000660> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000594> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000660> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000660> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000660> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Generatives Deep Learning"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000660> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "generative deep learning"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000660> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A deep learning process that involves creating models capable of generating new data instances that resemble the training data."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000660> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Deep Learning-Prozess, der Modelle erstellt, die in der Lage sind, neue Dateninstanzen zu erzeugen, die den Trainingsdaten ähneln."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000660> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Using generative adversarial networks to design new molecular structures with desired properties, such as improved conductivity or strength."@en .
