# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000666
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000666> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000666> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000957> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000666> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid409 .
_:genid409 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020102> .
_:genid409 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0009006> .
_:genid409 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
