_:genid416 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:genid416 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:genid417 .
_:genid417 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000769> .
