# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000821
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000821> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000821> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000933> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000821> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000821> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000821> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Maschinelles Lernen"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000821> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "machine learning"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000821> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A simulation process that uses algorithms to enable computers to learn from and make predictions based on data."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000821> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Simulationsprozess, der Algorithmen verwendet, um Computern das Lernen aus Daten und das Treffen von Vorhersagen zu ermöglichen."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000821> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Predicting the mechanical properties of composite materials based on their composition."@en .
