# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000822
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000822> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000822> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000927> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000822> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "Official definition can be found in: DIN 8589-0"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000822> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "Offizielle Definition findet man in: DIN 8589-0"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000822> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Spanen Mit Geometrisch Bestimmten Schneiden"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000822> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "machining geometrically defined"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000822> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A separating process that involves removing material with a tool that has a defined shape and sharp edges, such as in sawing and drilling operations."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000822> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Trennprozess, bei dem Material mit einem Werkzeug mit definierter Form und scharfen Kanten entfernt wird, wie z. B. beim Sägen und Bohren."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000822> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Drilling, Turning"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000823
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000823> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000823> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000927> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000823> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "Official definition can be found in: DIN 8589-0"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000823> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "Offizielle Definition findet man in: DIN 8589-0"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000823> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Spanen Mit Geometrisch Unbestimmten Schneiden"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000823> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "machining geometrically undefined"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000823> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A separating process that involves removing material using tools with undefined cutting edges, such as grinding or abrasive machining, where the exact shape of the cutting part isn't clearly defined."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000823> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Trennprozess, bei dem Material mit Werkzeugen mit undefinierten Schneiden abgetragen wird, wie z. B. beim Schleifen oder bei der abrasiven Bearbeitung, bei der die genaue Form des zu schneidenden Teils nicht klar definiert ist."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000823> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Grinding, Blasting"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000825
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000825> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000825> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DEPRECATED magnetic property"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000825> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DEPRECATED magnetische Eigenschaft"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000825> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020312> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000825> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000825> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED A magnetic property is a material property representing characteristics that describe how a material responds to magnetic fields, such as permeability and coercivity."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000825> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED Eine magnetische Eigenschaft ist eine Materialeigenschaft, die Eigenschaften darstellt, die beschreiben, wie ein Material auf Magnetfelder reagiert, wie z. B. Permeabilität und Koerzitivfeldstärke."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000826
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000826> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000826> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000550> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000826> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://industrylist.com/glossar/stoffeigenschaften-aendern/magnetisieren/"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000826> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Magnetisieren"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000826> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "magnetizing"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000826> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A changing properties of material process in which ferromagnetic materials are exposed to an external magnetic field, causing the material to take on magnetic properties."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000826> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Stoffeigenschaft Ändern Prozess, bei dem ferromagnetische Stoffe einem äußeren Magnetfeld ausgesetzt werden wodurch der Stoff magnetische Eigenschaften übernimmt."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000826> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Static Magnetization, Pulse Magnetization."@en .
