<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000835> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000835> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000835> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000835> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000835> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Massenspektrometer"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000835> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "mass spectrometer"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000835> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A device used to measure the mass-to-charge ratio of ions to identify and quantify compounds in a sample."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000835> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Gerät zur Messung des Massen-zu-Ladung-Verhältnisses von Ionen zur Identifizierung und Quantifizierung von Verbindungen in einer Probe."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000836
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000836> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000836> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000945> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000836> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000836> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000836> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Massenspektroskopie"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000836> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "mass spectrometry"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000836> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A spectroscopy process that measures the mass-to-charge ratio of ions to identify and quantify molecules in a sample."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000836> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Spektroskopie Verfahren, das das Masse-zu-Ladung-Verhältnis von Ionen misst, um Moleküle in einer Probe zu identifizieren und zu quantifizieren."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000836> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Examples are e.g. time-of-flight mass spectroscopy, particle beam mass spectrometry."@en .
