_:genid477 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000847> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000847> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000847> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Messfunktion"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000847> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "measuring function"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000847> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A function performed to determine the magnitude, quantity, or extent of a physical property or condition."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000847> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Eine Funktion, die durchgeführt wird, um das Ausmaß, die Menge oder den Zustand einer physikalischen Eigenschaft zu bestimmen."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000847> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000848
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000848> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000848> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "DEPRECATED The axiom that mechanical property has realization some application of mechanical load treats only conventional materials and not such effects as magnetostriction etc."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000848> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DEPRECATED mechanical property"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000848> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DEPRECATED mechanische Eigenschaft"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000848> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020311> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000848> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000848> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED A mechanical property is a material property which is a characteristic of material M. Mechanical property has realization in a stimulating process (in most cases, application of mechanical load), and the stimulating process is an occurent part of another process, in which an object O that is an instance of M participates."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000848> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED Eine mechanische Eigenschaft ist eine Materialeigenschaft, die eine Eigenschaft des Materials M ist. Eine mechanische Eigenschaft wird in einem stimulierenden Prozess (in den meisten Fällen durch Anwendung einer mechanischen Belastung) verwirklicht, und der stimulierende Prozess ist ein stattfindender Teil eines anderen Prozesses, an dem ein Objekt O, das eine Instanz von M ist, teilnimmt."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000070> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid478 .
_:genid478 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020311> .
_:genid478 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0009006> .
_:genid478 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Mechanische Eigenschaften Analyseverfahren"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "mechanical property analyzing process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An assay that evaluates the mechanical characteristics of materials, such as strength, hardness, elasticity, and tensile properties, often through tests that measure response to forces and loads."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Eine Analyse, die die mechanischen Eigenschaften von Materialien bewertet, wie z.B. Festigkeit, Härte, Elastizität und Zugfestigkeit, oft durch Tests, die die Reaktion auf Kräfte und Lasten messen."@de .
