<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000857> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The focus of interest when looking at an object through the microstructure perspective is often its morphology."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000857> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "microstructure"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000857> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A microstructure is a portion of matter that represents the small-scale structure of a material, including grains, phases, and defects, visible under a microscope."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000857> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
