<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A simulation process that integrates models at different scales to study a system's behavior."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Simulationsprozess, der Modelle auf verschiedenen Skalen integriert, um das Verhalten eines Systems zu untersuchen."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Studying the interaction between microstructural and macroscopic properties in metallic alloys."@en .
