<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000874> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A microscope that uses visible light and lenses to magnify and view small objects or details."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000874> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Mikroskop, das sichtbares Licht und Linsen verwendet, um kleine Objekte oder Details zu vergrößern und zu betrachten."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000875
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000875> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000875> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000856> .
