# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000924
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000924> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000924> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000773> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000924> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000924> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000924> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "A measure of a material's resistance to deformation or scratching by a harder material." .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000924> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Kratzhärte"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000924> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "scratch hardness"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Die Ritzhärte ist eine Härte, die ein Maß für den Widerstand eines Materials gegenüber Verformung oder Kratzern durch ein härteres Material darstellt."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The scratch hardness is a hardness representing a measure of a material's resistance to deformation or scratching by a harder material."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000924> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
