<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000955> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Classified by the role in a system."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000955> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "structural material"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000955> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A structural material S is an functional material which has the function to be used for an object O (O consists of S) and O's function is primarily mechanical load carrying."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000955> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
