# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000956
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000956> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000956> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000933> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000956> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000956> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000956> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Strukturoptimierungssimulation"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000956> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "structural optimization simulation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000956> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A simulation process that aims to find the most stable structure of a molecular system by minimizing its energy."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000956> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Simulationsprozess, der darauf abzielt, die stabilste Struktur eines molekularen Systems durch Minimierung seiner Energie zu finden."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000956> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Optimizing the atomic structure of a catalyst to enhance its performance."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000957
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000957> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000957> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0000070> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000957> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000957> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000957> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Struktur Eigenschaften Analyseverfahren"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000957> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "structural property analyzing process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000957> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An assay that examines the external and internal structure and morphology of materials, including the arrangement of atoms, crystals, grains, and phases, often using techniques like microscopy and diffraction."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000957> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Eine Analyse, die die äußere und innere Struktur und Morphologie von Materialien untersucht, einschließlich der Anordnung von Atomen, Kristallen, Körnern und Phasen, oft unter Verwendung von Techniken wie Mikroskopie und Beugung."@de .
