<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000964> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "supervised machine learning"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000964> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "supervised machine learning"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000964> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A machine learning process that learns a function mapping from input data to labeled output data."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000964> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Maschinelles Lernen Prozess, der eine Funktion erlernt, die Eingabedaten auf beschriftete Ausgabedaten abbildet."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000964> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Training a model to predict the tensile strength of a material based on its composition and manufacturing process parameters. This involves using a dataset where the tensile strength is already known (labeled data) to train the model."@en .
