<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Oberflächenschicht (Fiat-Objektteil)"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "surface layer (fiat object part)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A surface layer (fiat object part) is a fiat object part that is part of only object. The surface layer is the three dimensional region defining the outermost layer of an object, where surface-interactions with other material entities occur. What is considered as the surface is thus defined by the interaction process."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Eine Oberflächenschicht (Fiat-Objektteil) ist ein Fiat-Objektteil, der nur Teil eines Objekts ist. Die Oberflächenschicht ist der dreidimensionale Bereich, der die äußerste Schicht eines Objekts definiert, wo Oberflächeninteraktionen mit anderen materiellen Einheiten stattfinden. Was als Oberfläche betrachtet wird, wird somit durch den Interaktionsprozess definiert."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "When considering optical properties of a surface layer (fiat object part) of a polished piece of metal we likely consider a different three dimensional spatial region than when considering the scratch hardness properties of the same polished piece of metal."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000965> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000966
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000966> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000966> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000966> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000966> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000966> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Oberflächenprofilometer"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000966> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "surface profilometer"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000966> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A device used to measure the surface profile and texture of materials."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000966> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Gerät zur Messung des Oberflächenprofils und der Textur von Materialien."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023043> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The concept refers to an absolute temperature, not to be mistaken with temperature difference."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "To express that an object has a temperature, the property 'intensive bearer of' can be used. It implies a chain of: object consists of some portion of matter and portion of matter bearer of some temperature."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Temperatur"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "temperature"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Die Temperatur ist eine grundlegende intensive Qualität, die die durchschnittliche atomare oder molekulare Bewegung oder Schwingung eines Teils der Materie darstellt."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The temperature is a fundamental intensive quality representing the average atomic or molcular movement or vibration of a portion of matter."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000967> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000602> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Temperaturänderungswerkzeug"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "temperature change device"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A device that is used for the alteration and adjustment of the temperature of a tangible object or the environment, e.g., a furnace and cooling media."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000968> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Diese Entität beschreibt allgemein jedes Werkzeug, das zur Änderung und Einstellung der Temperatur eines materiellen Objekts oder der Umgebung verwendet wird, z. B. einen Ofen und Kühlmittel."@de .
