# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000972
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000972> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000972> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020353> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000972> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000972> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000972> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "temporal property"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000972> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "zeitliche Eigenschaft"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000972> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A temporal property is a material property that represents attributes related to the time-dependent behavior of a material or process."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000972> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Eine zeitliche Eigenschaft ist eine Materialeigenschaft, die Attribute darstellt, die sich auf das zeitabhängige Verhalten eines Materials oder Prozesses beziehen."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000972> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
