<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000973> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Zugprüfmaschine"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000973> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tensile testing machine"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000973> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A device used to test the tensile strength and elongation of materials by applying a stretching force."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000973> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Gerät zur Prüfung der Zugfestigkeit und Dehnung von Materialien durch Anwendung einer Dehnkraft."@de .
