# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000974
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000974> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000974> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000849> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000974> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000974> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000974> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Zugprüfverfahren"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000974> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tensile testing process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000974> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A mechanical property analyzing process that determines a material's response to tensile forces, measuring its tensile strength, elongation, and Young's modulus."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000974> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Mechanische Eigenschaften Analyseverfahren, das die Reaktion eines Materials auf Zugkräfte bestimmt und seine Zugfestigkeit, Dehnung und seinen Elastizitätsmodul misst."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000974> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Tensile testing of polymer films to ensure they can stretch without breaking in packaging applications"@en .
