<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Using clustering algorithms to group similar materials based on their properties (e.g., hardness, elasticity, thermal conductivity) without prior knowledge of the categories. For instance, discovering new categories of alloy compositions that exhibit similar thermal properties."@en .
