<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001015> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001015> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Joerg Waitelonis" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001015> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Röntgen-Computertomographie"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001015> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "x-ray computed tomography"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A X-ray analyzing process, that uses X-rays to create detailed cross-sectional images of an object."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Röntgenanalyseverfahren, das Röntgenstrahlen verwendet, um detaillierte Querschnittsbilder eines Objekts zu erstellen."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "For example, X-ray Computed Tomography can be used to analyze the porosity of cement. This process allows researchers to visualize and quantify the distribution, size, and connectivity of pores within the cement."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0001015> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0050117> "CT"@en .
