<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010029> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "spezifische Festigkeit"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010029> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#comment> "SI unit for specific strength is Pa⋅m3/kg, or N⋅m/kg, which is dimensionally equivalent to m2/s2, In fiber or textile applications, tenacity is the usual measure of specific strength\n" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010029> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Specific strength is a quality that inheres in a material entity and is defined as the ratio of its tensile strength to its density."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0010029> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Spezifische Festigkeit ist eine Eigenschaft, die einem Material innewohnt und als das Verhältnis seiner Zugfestigkeit zu seiner Dichte definiert wird."@de .
