<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020098> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "nature constant"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A nature constant is a generically dependent continuant whose value, maginitude or configuration is determined by nature including physics and mathematics."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Eine Naturkonstante ist ein generisch abhängiger Kontinuant, dessen Wert, Größe oder Konfiguration durch die Natur, einschließlich Physik und Mathematik, bestimmt wird."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Examples of nature constants are the speed of light, pi, etc."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020098> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
