# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020099
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020099> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020099> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020099> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Philipp von Hartrott" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020099> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "TODO: possibly extend for 2D (Graphene etc)\n\nMore elaborate crystal descriptions may be found in http://emmo.info/domain-crystallography/crystallography or https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/disos/cso"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020099> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bravais-Gitter (3D)"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020099> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice (3D)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020099> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020099> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Das Bravais-Gitter ist eine kategoriale Wertspezifikation, die den Wert der Kristallstrukturqualität angibt. Es beschreibt die mögliche geometrische Anordnung von Gitterpunkten in einem Kristall. Der vorliegende Deskriptor beschränkt sich auf die 14 möglichen dreidimensionalen Anordnungen."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020099> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The bravais lattice is a categorical value specification that specifies value of the crystal structure quality. It describes the possible geometric arrangement of lattice points in a crystal. The present descriptor is limited to the 14 possible three-dimensional arrangements."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020099> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020353> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020101> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid999 .
