# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020116
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020116> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020116> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Make entity member of subclass of 'portion of matter in aggregate state'" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020116> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DEPRECATED aggregate state value"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020116> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DEPRECATED aggregierter Zustandswert"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020116> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED Der Aggregatzustandswert ist eine kategoriale Wertspezifikation, die den Wert der Aggregatzustandsqualität angibt."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED The aggregate state value is a categorical value specification that specifies value of the aggregate state quality."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020126
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020126> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020126> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000890> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020126> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "old defintion: A foam is a material entity aggregate that is also a composite material c. \nThe parts of c that have the filler role are vacuum-filled or gas filled pores. \nThe parts of c that have the matrix role consist of a material that is bearer of solid or liquid aggregate state. \nOne pore with its surrounding matrix is called 'cell'. \nDepending on the interconnectedness of the pores the foam is open- or closed-cell." .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020126> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "foam"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020126> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A foam is a connected material entity aggregate that consists of a solid or liquid matrix containing gas-filled or vacuum-filled pores forming cellular structures."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020126> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
