<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020135> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020135> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Will deal with causality later" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020135> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DEPRECATED Stimulationszielrolle"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020135> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DEPRECATED stimulation target role"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020135> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020135> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED See 'Stimulus role'"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020135> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "DEPRECATED Siehe „Stimulusrolle“"@de .
