<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020150> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'volume' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'DimensionQuality'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions. The definition is adapted from: http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000918."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020150> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Philipp von Hartrott" .
