<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020158> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "parent phase role"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020158> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The parent phase role is the role of a phase that dissolves during the phase transformation process. As such, the bearer is a metastable phase."@en .
