<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Heizung"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "heating"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Erwärmung ist eine Temperaturänderung, die dem Temperaturanstieg im System oder Objekt entspricht."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Heating is a change of temperature which corresponds to the increase of temperature in the system or object."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000549> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Kühlung"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "cooling"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Cooling is a change of temperature which corresponds to the decrease of temperature in the system or object."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Kühlung ist eine Temperaturänderung, die einem Temperaturabfall im System oder Objekt entspricht."@de .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025012
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025012> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025012> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000583> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025012> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025012> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Kamilla Zaripova" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025012> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "analytical calculation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Analytical calculation is a computing process which has value specification or measurement datum as a specified output. It applies a closed-form mathematical expression or formula to a set it specified inputs (value specifications) without requiring stochastic sampling, iterative numerical solving, or data-driven training."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025014
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025014> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
