<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025014> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "single crystal"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025014> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Single crystal is a crystal which is not part of a polycrystal and its boundaries are its external surfaces."@en .
