<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025029> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "an object or a portion of matter with reducing agent role is oxidized,  i.e., gives up electrons, thus leading to metal reduction, i.e., gain of electrons, in a chemical reaction."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0025029> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Carbon in a smelting of an ore" .
