<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0050000> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020353> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0050000> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid1800 .
