<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0050153> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A length that describes the measured dimension in one direction of a test piece."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0050153> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Diese Klasse beschreibt das gemessene Maß in einer Richtung eines Prüfkörpers."@de .
# 
