<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080021> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'sound reflection coefficient' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'acoustic quality'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080021> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080021> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Schallreflexionsgrad"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080021> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "sound reflection coefficient"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080021> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Schallreflexionsgrad quantifiziert den Anteil der Schallenergie, die von einer Oberfläche reflektiert wird"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080021> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sound reflection coefficient quantifies the proportion of sound energy reflected by a surface"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080021> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A concrete wall has a sound reflection coefficient near 0.99 at 500 Hz, acting nearly as a perfect reflector"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080021> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
