<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080022> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080022> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "electric charge"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080022> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "elektrische Ladung"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080022> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Electric charge refers to the physical property of matter causing it to experience a force when placed in an electromagnetic field"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080022> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A capacitor stores 10 µC of electric charge at a voltage of 5 V"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080023
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080023> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080023> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020353> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080023> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080023> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'electric field strength' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'electrical quality'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions. The definition is adapted from: https://www.britannica.com/science/electric-field."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080023> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080023> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://www.britannica.com/science/electric-field> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080023> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "electric field strength"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080023> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "elektrische Feldstärke"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080023> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Die Stärke oder Intensität des elektrischen Feldes bezieht sich auf die Stärke und Richtung des elektrischen Feldes an einem Punkt und ist entscheidend für die Bestimmung der Auswirkungen auf elektrische Ladungen in der Nähe dieses Punktes"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080023> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Electric field strength, or intensity, refers to the magnitude and direction of the electric field at a point, crucial for determining effects on electric charges near that point"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080023> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Between parallel capacitor plates separated by 1 mm at 100 V, the electric field strength is 1e5 V/m"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080023> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
