<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080024> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000019> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080024> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0023004> .
