# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080065
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080065> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080065> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000008> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080065> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080065> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'wavelength' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'length'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions. The definition is adapted from: https://www.oxfordreference.com/display/10.1093/oi/authority.20110803121421585."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080065> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080065> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://www.oxfordreference.com/display/10.1093/oi/authority.20110803121421585> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080065> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Wellenlänge"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080065> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "wavelength"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080065> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Wavelength is the distance between successive peaks or troughs of a wave, equal to wave speed divided by frequency"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080065> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Wellenlänge ist die Entfernung zwischen aufeinanderfolgenden Gipfeln oder Tälern einer Welle, gleich der Wellenbewegungsgeschwindigkeit geteilt durch die Frequenz"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080065> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A green laser pointer emits light at a wavelength of 532 nm"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080065> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
