# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080067
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080067> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080067> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0040001> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080067> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080067> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'perimeter' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'length'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions. The definition is adapted from: http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001711."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080067> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080067> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001711> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080067> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Umfang"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080067> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "perimeter"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080067> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Der Umfang misst eine eindimensionale Ausdehnung, die einem zweidimensionalen Träger innewohnt und die Entfernung um ihn herum darstellt"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080067> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Perimeter measures a 1-D extent inhering in a two-dimensional bearer, representing the distance around it"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080067> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The perimeter of a square cross-section beam of 50 mm side length is 200 mm"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080067> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
