<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080068> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "circumference"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080068> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Circumference characterizes a 1-D extent equal to the length of the closed curve of a circle"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080068> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Der Umfang charakterisiert eine eindimensionale Ausdehnung, die der Länge der geschlossenen Kurve eines Kreises entspricht"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080068> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A wire of 2 mm diameter has a circumference of 6.28 mm"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080068> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
