<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080082> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'coefficient of friction' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'physical relational quality'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions not yet expressed as OWL restrictions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080082> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080082> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Reibungskoeffizient"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080082> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "coefficient of friction"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Reibwert"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "friction coefficient"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "μ"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Coefficient of friction is a dimensionless scalar quality of a pair of surfaces in contact that expresses the ratio of the friction force between them to the normal force pressing them together"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Der Reibungskoeffizient ist eine dimensionslose skalare Qualität eines Paars in Kontakt stehender Oberflächen, die das Verhältnis der Reibungskraft zwischen ihnen zur Normalkraft ausdrückt, die sie zusammendrückt"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080082> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
