# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080083
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080083> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080083> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020353> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080083> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080083> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'inductance' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'physical relational quality'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions. The definition is adapted from: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inductance."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080083> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080083> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inductance> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080083> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Induktion"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080083> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "inductance"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080083> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Inductance is the tendency of an electrical conductor to oppose a change in electric current through electromagnetic induction, creating back electromotive force"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080083> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Induktivität ist die Tendenz eines elektrischen Leiters, einer Änderung des elektrischen Stroms durch elektromagnetische Induktion entgegenzuwirken und so eine elektromotorische Gegenkraft zu erzeugen"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080083> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A solenoid coil of 100 turns has an inductance of 1 mH, opposing rapid current changes"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080083> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
