<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080085> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Gewichtskraft"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080085> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "weight"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080085> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "In science and engineering, the weight of an object, is the force acting on the object due to acceleration of gravity."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080085> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A concrete block has a weight of 2.5 kN in the gravitational field at sea level"@en .
