<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080087> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'thrust' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'force'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions. The definition is adapted from: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thrust."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080087> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080087> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thrust> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080087> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Schubkraft"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080087> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "thrust"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080087> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Schubkraft ist eine von Newtons drittem Gesetz beschriebene Kraft, bei der Massenbeschleunigung in eine Richtung eine gleich große Kraft in die entgegengesetzte Richtung verursacht"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080087> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Thrust is a force described by Newton's third law, where mass expulsion in one direction causes an equal force in the opposite direction"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080087> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A jet engine produces 150 kN of thrust at takeoff conditions"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080087> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
