<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080095> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'contact angle' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'physical relational quality'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions not yet expressed as OWL restrictions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080095> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080095> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Kontaktwinkel"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080095> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "contact angle"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Benetzungswinkel"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "wetting angle"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "θ"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Contact angle is a physical relational quality of a solid surface that quantifies the angle formed at the three-phase contact line between a liquid droplet, the solid surface, and the surrounding gas phase, characterizing the wettability of the surface by the liquid"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Kontaktwinkel ist eine physikalische relationale Qualität einer festen Oberfläche, die den Winkel an der Dreiphasengrenzlinie zwischen einem Flüssigkeitstropfen, der festen Oberfläche und der umgebenden Gasphase beschreibt und die Benetzbarkeit der Oberfläche durch die Flüssigkeit charakterisiert"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A hydrophobic polymer coating shows a water contact angle of 110 degrees, indicating poor wettability"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080095> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
