<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080108> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080108> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Spannung"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080108> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "stress"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080108> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Stress is the internal force per unit area a material experiences under external load, commonly described in tensile, compressive, or shear forms"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080108> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A cross-section of a loaded steel column bears a compressive stress of 150 MPa"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080108> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
