_:genid2127 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080108> .
_:genid2127 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> .
_:genid2127 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> _:genid2122 .
_:genid2127 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mechanical view on stress"@en .
