_:genid2136 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedSource> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080110> .
_:genid2136 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedProperty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> .
_:genid2136 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#annotatedTarget> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080108> .
_:genid2136 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Express that force and area are properties dependent of \"TQC of the deformation process\""@en .
