<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080111> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080111> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Kriechspannung"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080111> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "creep stress"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Creep stress is characterized by strain occurring with time when a constant force is applied to a physical body"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A polymer gasket under a creep stress of 5 MPa at 60 C relaxes significantly over 1000 hours"@en .
