<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080118> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "gravitational potential"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080118> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "the potential due to mass"@en .
