<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080129> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'electrical conductance' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'electrical capability'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080129> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080129> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "electrical conductance"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080129> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "elektrischer Leitwert"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Stromleitwert"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "electrical conductance"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "elektrischer Leitwert"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Der elektrische Leitwert stellt den Kehrwert des elektrischen Widerstands eines Leiters dar und misst seine Fähigkeit, elektrischen Strom zu leiten, angegeben in Siemens (S)."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Electrical conductance represents the reciprocal of a conductor's electrical resistance, measuring its ability to conduct an electric current, denoted in siemens (S)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "A copper wire of 1 m length and 1 mm2 cross-section has an electrical conductance of about 59 S"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080129> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
