# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080131
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080131> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080131> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020312> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080131> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080131> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'saturation magnetization' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'magnetic capability'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions not yet expressed as OWL restrictions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080131> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080131> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Sättigungsmagnetisierung"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080131> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "saturation magnetization"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "M_s"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "magnetic saturation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "magnetische Sättigung"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Saturation magnetization is a magnetic capability of a material that specifies the maximum magnetic moment per unit volume achieved when all magnetic domains are aligned with an applied external field"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sättigungsmagnetisierung ist eine magnetische Fähigkeit eines Materials, die das maximale magnetische Moment pro Volumeneinheit angibt, das erreicht wird, wenn alle magnetischen Domänen mit einem angelegten äußeren Feld ausgerichtet sind"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080131> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020353> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'durability' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'mechanical capability'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Dauerhaftigkeit"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "durability"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Dauerhaftigkeit"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Langlebigkeit"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "durability"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "longevity"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Die Dauerhaftigkeit ist die Fähigkeit eines Materials, Abnutzung, Rissbildung und andere Arten von Schäden im Laufe der Zeit zu widerstehen"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Durability is the ability of a material to resist wear, tear, and other types of damage over time"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Galvanized steel shows high durability in outdoor environments, resisting corrosion for over 50 years"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080133> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
