<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080157> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Shear strength is the maximum shear stress a material can withstand before failure along a plane parallel to the applied force"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080157> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Shear strength of a CFRP laminate specimen measured as 85 MPa according to ISO 14130 test conditions."@en .
