# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020335> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'weathering resistance' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'operational strength'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Was a subclass of 'Operational Strength';  But 'Operational Strength' does not appear to be Quality."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Witterungsbeständigkeit"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "weathering resistance"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Witterungsbeständigkeit"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "weather resistant"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "weathering resistance"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "wetterbeständig"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ability of a material to resist the effects of weathering, such as wind, rain, and sunlight."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Fähigkeit eines Materials, den Auswirkungen von Witterungseinflüssen wie Wind, Regen und Sonnenlicht standzuhalten."@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "HDPE pipes show high weathering resistance, retaining mechanical properties after years of UV exposure"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080159> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
