<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080163> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Fatigue strength denotes a material's ability to resist fatigue or cyclic loading"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080163> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The fatigue strength of steel at 10^7 cycles is approximately half its tensile strength"@en .
