<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080166> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Shear modulus is a measure of elastic shear stiffness, defined as the ratio of shear stress to shear strain"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080166> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "The shear modulus of aluminum is 26 GPa, governing torsional deformation of shafts"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080166> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
