<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080167> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'specific elastic modulus' have not yet been formalized. Although specific elastic modulus is defined as a ratio of elastic modulus to density, a co-inherence axiom cannot uniquely identify this quality among all stiffness qualities of the same bearer. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'stiffness'."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080167> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080167> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "specific elastic modulus"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080167> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "spezifischer Elastizitätsmodul"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "specific modulus"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "specific stiffness"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "spezifische Steifigkeit"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "spezifischer Modul"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Specific elastic modulus is a stiffness quality of a material expressed as the ratio of its elastic modulus to its density, representing the material's elastic stiffness per unit mass"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Spezifischer Elastizitätsmodul ist eine Steifigkeitsqualität eines Materials, ausgedrückt als Verhältnis seines Elastizitätsmoduls zu seiner Dichte und repräsentiert die elastische Steifigkeit des Materials je Masseneinheit"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080167> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
