<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080168> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080168> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Biegemodul"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080168> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "flexural modulus"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080168> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "bending modulus"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080168> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Flexural modulus is a stiffness quality of a material that specifies the ratio of stress to strain in the elastic region of a bending test, representing resistance to elastic deformation under flexural load"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080168> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Flexural modulus of a glass-fibre reinforced polyamide measured as 9.5 GPa under ISO 178 three-point bending test conditions."@en .
