<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080169> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "adhesion strength"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080169> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Adhesion strength measures the force required to separate two surfaces bonded together"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080169> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "An epoxy adhesive joint on steel substrates has an adhesion strength of 20 MPa in lap shear testing"@en .
