# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080170
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080170> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080170> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020353> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080170> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080170> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "Necessary and sufficient conditions for 'plasticity' have not yet been formalized. The term is defined as a specific subtype of 'strength'. Distinguishing criteria are domain-specific and depend on measurement conventions or source terminology not yet expressed as OWL restrictions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080170> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> "PERSON: Thomas Hanke" .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080170> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Plastizität"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080170> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "plasticity"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080170> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Plastizität"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080170> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "plasticity"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080170> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Plasticity signifies a material's ability to undergo permanent deformation without breaking or cracking"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080170> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Plastizität bezeichnet die Fähigkeit eines Materials, dauerhafte Verformungen ohne Bruch oder Riss zu erleiden"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080170> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Low-carbon steel exhibits high plasticity, allowing deep drawing without cracking"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0080170> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
