<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020006> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020006> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice triclinic primitive"@en .
