# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020007
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020007> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020007> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice monoclinic primitive"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020007> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "monoklines Grundelement des Bravais-Gitters"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020007> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020007> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Monoklines Bravais-Gitter mit primitiver Zentrierung (mP) mit einer zweizähligen Rotationsachse mit einem schiefen Winkel und zwei rechten Winkeln zwischen den Achsen der Elementarzellen"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020007> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "monoclinic Bravais lattice with primitive centering (mP), having one 2-fold rotation axis with one oblique angle and two right angles between unit cell axes"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020007> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
