# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020008
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020008> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020008> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bravais-Gitter monoklin basiszentriert"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020008> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice monoclinic base-centered"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020008> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020008> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "monoclinic Bravais lattice with base-centered centering (mC), having one 2-fold rotation axis and additional lattice points at the center of one pair of faces"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020008> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "monoklines Bravais-Gitter mit basiszentrierter Zentrierung (mC), einer zweizähligen Rotationsachse und zusätzlichen Gitterpunkten in der Mitte eines Flächenpaares"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020008> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020009
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020009> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020009> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bravais-Gitter orthorombisches Grundelement"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020009> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice orthorombic primitive"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020009> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "orthorhombic Bravais lattice with primitive centering (oP), having three mutually perpendicular 2-fold rotation axes and one lattice point per unit cell"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "orthorhombisches Bravais-Gitter mit primitiver Zentrierung (oP), mit drei zueinander senkrechten zweizähligen Rotationsachsen und einem Gitterpunkt pro Elementarzelle"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020009> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
