# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020010
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020010> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bravais-Gitter orthorhombisch basiszentriert"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice orthorhombic base-centered"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020010> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "orthorhombic Bravais lattice with base-centered centering (oC), having three perpendicular 2-fold axes and additional lattice points at the centers of one pair of faces"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "orthorhombisches Bravais-Gitter mit basiszentrierter Zentrierung (oC), mit drei senkrechten zweizähligen Achsen und zusätzlichen Gitterpunkten in den Mittelpunkten eines Flächenpaares"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020010> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
