# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020011
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020011> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bravais-Gitter orthorhombisch körperzentriert"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020011> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice orthorhombic body-centered"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020011> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "orthorhombic Bravais lattice with body-centered centering (oI), having three perpendicular 2-fold axes and an additional lattice point at the center of the unit cell"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "orthorhombisches Bravais-Gitter mit körperzentrierter Zentrierung (oI), mit drei senkrechten zweizähligen Achsen und einem zusätzlichen Gitterpunkt in der Mitte der Elementarzelle"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020011> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020012
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020012> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020012> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bravais-Gitter orthorhombisch flächenzentriert"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020012> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice orthorhombic face-centered"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020012> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "orthorhombic Bravais lattice with face-centered centering (oF), having three perpendicular 2-fold axes and additional lattice points at the centers of all faces"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "orthorhombisches Bravais-Gitter mit flächenzentrierter Zentrierung (oF), mit drei senkrechten zweizähligen Achsen und zusätzlichen Gitterpunkten in den Mittelpunkten aller Flächen"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020012> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020013
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020013> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020013> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bravais-Gitter tetragonaler Grundkörper"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020013> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "OBSOLETE bravais lattice tetragonal primitive"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020013> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020013> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "tetragonal Bravais lattice with primitive centering (tP), having one 4-fold rotation axis with two equal unit cell axes perpendicular to a third unequal axis"@en .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020013> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "tetragonales Bravais-Gitter mit primitiver Zentrierung (tP), mit einer vierzähligen Rotationsachse mit zwei gleichen Elementarzellenachsen senkrecht zu einer dritten ungleichen Achse"@de .
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020013> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000060> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020014
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020014> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
